flowchart TB
    A[PS Cortex-A53<br/>处理系统裸机程序] --> B[AXI-Lite Registers<br/>控制寄存器]
    A --> C[AXI DMA MM2S<br/>内存到数据流]
    C --> D[Viterbi AXI Stream Wrapper<br/>译码器流接口封装]
    D --> E[AXI DMA S2MM<br/>数据流回内存]
    E --> A
